<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's 1997 GDP seen growing at about 6 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's 1997 GDP seen growing at about 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's gross domestic product (GDP) was forecast to grow at about six percent in 1997, compared with an estimated 6.9 percent for 1996, the Ministry of Finance and Economy said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
